have the exact same reaction I did.

80
00:04:05,920 --> 00:04:06,320
No for it.

81
00:04:06,320 --> 00:04:11,920
I just used a large language model to plan a highly detailed seven-day vacation to Tokyo.

82
00:04:11,920 --> 00:04:13,320
Yeah, it was great.

83
00:04:13,420 --> 00:04:14,740
It gave me hotel recommendations.

84
00:04:14,980 --> 00:04:17,880
It told me exactly which train lines to take at what times.

85
00:04:18,020 --> 00:04:19,240
It factored in my budget.

86
00:04:19,340 --> 00:04:20,820
I mean, it planned perfectly.

87
00:04:21,100 --> 00:04:26,100
So how can this paper claim that modern AI lacks the ability to understand reachability

88
00:04:26,100 --> 00:04:26,660
and planning?

89
00:04:27,060 --> 00:04:29,500
That right there is the illusion of observation.

90
00:04:29,800 --> 00:04:31,240
The illusion of observation.

91
00:04:31,520 --> 00:04:31,760
Yes.

92
00:04:32,420 --> 00:04:38,820
When an AI generates a beautiful itinerary for your Tokyo trip, it is not actually evaluating

